0..75 Comment "//! This source supplies the declarations that the Brunerie ladder\'s length"
76..97 Comment "//! benchmarks share."
98..101 Comment "//!"
102..170 Comment "//! Each benchmark must state the same terms as cctt\'s files. So the"
171..243 Comment "//! benchmarks share one copy of cctt\'s numerals and its integer reader."
244..247 Comment "//!"
248..325 Comment "//! The numerals are products of ten, as cctt\'s `tests/bench/nat.cctt` states"
326..396 Comment "//! them. A numeral is a call, so a run computes it before it uses it."
397..474 Comment "//! `forceInt` reads an integer to its last constructor, as the `forceℤ` of"
475..553 Comment "//! `tests/bench/int.cctt` does. `loops` writes the loop word of a length, one"
554..575 Comment "//! letter at a time."
576..579 Comment "//!"
580..596 Comment "//! - see: #6309"
